episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As Nemu ponders the Asakuras' finances,Miharu asks Jun'ichi to take her shoping. They run into Nemu, who does a little shoping of her own.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-10-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cztnHsMlBqTfK8xBWREuI8VdyjE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cztnHsMlBqTfK8xBWREuI8VdyjE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/26444/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"670545","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"前半を振りかえって、今までのエピソードの総集編。しかもただの総集編ではない。杉並曰く、｢ドキッ! 美女だらけのダ・カーポ総集編 ポロリもあるよ｣なのである。今までの、頼子の過去、ことりとの文化祭の思い出、眞子との恋人ごっこなど、皆との様々なエピソードがよみがえる。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-10-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eg1eFaKsp5BRZ3B4T8kla3GFRdF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eg1eFaKsp5BRZ3B4T8kla3GFRdF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/26444/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"670546","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"音夢の指にある指輪に気付いたさくらは、その指輪が純一からのプレゼントだと聞くと、自分も何かが欲しいと純一におねだりを始めた。音夢の複雑な想いに気付かない純一は、プレゼントをあげることを約束する。指輪ではなく別のものが欲しい……そんなさくらの望んだプレゼントとは、一体何なのか?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-10-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lVz7UDwKXLNnWKp6KsbU3jdiBcQ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lVz7UDwKXLNnWKp6KsbU3jdiBcQ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/26444/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"670547","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"さくらの願いをかなえるために、純一はさくらの家へ泊まりに行った。そこで、懐かしい夢を見る。さくらと初めて出会った頃の夢を……。 一方、美春と共に映画を見に行った音夢。初めての映画に興奮した美春は、いきなり煙を吹き出してしまう。そして音夢は、美春の正体を知るのだった。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-10-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/59ffSjEWQVq1BvN8ONoP05yqVhq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/59ffSjEWQVq1BvN8ONoP05yqVhq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/26444/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"670548","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"さくらと一緒にいた純一のいつもと違う様子に、音夢はショックを受けてしまう。純一は、さくらを選んだのか? ただ涙を流す音夢。そして純一もまた、音夢への本当の気持ちに向き合うことになる。幼かった頃の自分と、変わっていってしまった想い……。ふたりの関係が変わろうとしていた。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-11-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xE1QKYdPttQKFtcQa3YFZcrbsU2.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xE1QKYdPttQKFtcQa3YFZcrbsU2.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/26444/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"670549","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After the entire school finds out how the relationship between Junichi and Nemu has developed, Sakura and Suginami try to stop them before they take their relationship even further.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-11-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lLVJ74Pu5LmyybDxyGXU712QaaX.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lLVJ74Pu5LmyybDxyGXU712QaaX.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/26444/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"670550","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Seeing Jun'ichi and Nemu closer than ever before, Sakura tries to pull them apart using Jun'ichi's sense of honor,